<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<!--
  Space walking for the Shipcracker armor under Vanilla Gravship Expanded. Odyssey's Space
  terrain is Impassable; VGE1 makes it Standable at pathCost 490 for everyone, so the suit
  only makes the crawl bearable. VEF's ApparelExtension.moveSpeedFactorByTerrainTag divides
  the whole per-cell cost (ticks per move plus the terrain's 490) by the factor, before the
  450 clamp, on cells whose TerrainDef.tags hold the key (Odyssey tags Space "Space"). VGE2's
  astrorig uses 27.5.

  Factor 19: at the 4.6 c/s baseline (13 ticks per move), (13 + 490) / 19 = 26.5 ticks per
  cell, about half walking speed and a clear step below the astrorig's 18.3 (about 70
  percent). Unaided the cell costs the clamped 450.

  Appended to the armor's existing ApparelExtension, whose priority 1 is what keeps this
  field alive through VEF's extension merge; see the armor def's header.
-->
<Patch>
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationAdd">
    <xpath>Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName="SCWC_Warcasket_Shipcracker"]/modExtensions/li[@Class="VEF.Apparels.ApparelExtension"]</xpath>
    <value>
      <moveSpeedFactorByTerrainTag>
        <li>
          <key>Space</key>
          <value>
            <li>
              <moveSpeedFactor>19</moveSpeedFactor>
            </li>
          </value>
        </li>
      </moveSpeedFactorByTerrainTag>
    </value>
  </Operation>
</Patch>
